5,1,1,talk,Servas,,We must ensure the human element is secure. I shall look into staffing rolls for technical posts and minutes on secondments and crew strength.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Sakura,,I want to see where the money actually goes! I'll check travel and bench-fee lines in the ledgers and national computing agreement and facility day rates.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I... I think we should see what actually worked before. I'll look at closeout files of finished awards and portfolio review of schedule overruns.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Takumi,,I'm tired of surprises. I'm checking incident logs on shared instrumentation and station records from partner field sites.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Minako,,Infrastructure is the bottleneck. I will examine accreditation and bookings at shared facilities and national repository deposit turnaround.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
